  {"study_index": 200, "title": "Influence of smoking habits on Down\'s syndrome risk evaluation at mid‐trimester       
  through biochemical screening", "abstract": "Expectant mothers who smoke have higher levels of maternal serum         
  alpha-fetoprotein and lower levels of unconjugated estriol and total human chorionic gonadotrophin than non-smoking   
