was achieved with assisted reproduction techniques were matched with five controls resulting in 370 singleton controls 
and 150 twin controls. NT was measured using the Fetal Medicine Foundation protocol. Free β‐hCG, PAPP‐A and NT levels 
were compared between the IVF and control groups and between the ICSI and control groups using the Mann‐Whitney U test. 
