│ aneuploidies, and are faster and less expensive than karyotyping.nature.com"}, {"study_index": 391, "title":         │
│ "Estimates for the sensitivity and false‐positive rates for second trimester serum screening for Down syndrome and   │
│ trisomy 18 with adjustment for cross‐identification and double‐positive results", "abstract": "Second trimester      │
│ screening for fetal Down syndrome and trisomy 18 is available through separate protocols that combine the maternal   │
│ age‐specific risk and the analysis of maternal serum markers. We have determined the extent to which additional Down │
