│ were significantly associated with PIH and IUGR. Finally decreased β-hCG< 0, 48MoM were found to be significantly    │
│ associated with IUGR, PIH and IUD. Conclusion: Triple test can be used not only for the detection of fetal           │
│ chromosomal and NTD abnormalities but also for the detection of high-risk pregnancies.journals.viamedica.pl"},       │
│ {"study_index": 394, "title": "Maternal urinary ß‐core fragment of hCG/creatinine ratios and fetal chromosomal       │
│ abnormalities in the second trimester of pregnancy", "abstract": "Our aim was to evaluate the potential value of the │
